  "description": "Polaris destination consumers v1: per-vendor delivery success/failure rates, failure breakdown by error_class, retry and DLQ counters, plus delivery duration and rate-limit wait gauges. Panels reference `polaris_destination_*` metrics defined in packages/shared-destinations/src/metrics.ts. The $vendor variable picks one of the five v1 consumers (webhook-sink, meta-capi, tiktok, ga4, braze).",
