      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Polaris Destinations\n\nMetrics from `packages/shared-destinations/src/metrics.ts`, exposed at each destination consumer's `/metrics` endpoint.\n\n**error_class closed set** (per `packages/shared-destinations/src/db/delivery-records.ts`): `consent`, `identity`, `mapping`, `auth`, `rate_limit`, `transient`, `permanent`, `timeout`, `policy`. The failure breakdown panel splits by this label.\n\n**Per-vendor row.** The template variable `$vendor` selects one of `webhook-sink`, `meta-capi`, `tiktok`, `ga4`, `braze`. Pick `All` to see the fleet aggregate.\n\n**Latency.** `polaris_destination_delivery_duration_seconds` is a histogram (CSH8YAL6); the p50/p99 panel at the bottom of the dashboard uses it. The legacy `_ms_last` gauge is kept alongside during the transition for the `max` / `lastNotNull` panel.\n\n**DLQ backlog.** DLQ growth is shown as a **rate** here; for a true backlog gauge, query the `dlq_records` table via the DLQ triage runbook (P10-006).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": ["mean", "max"]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (vendor) (rate(polaris_destination_events_delivered_total{vendor=~\"$vendor\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{vendor}} \u2014 delivered",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Delivery success rate per vendor (5m, ops)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
