      "description": "Planned non-deliveries. These are NOT failures and never were, but until the routing gate landed the unmapped ones were recorded as mapped_failed and counted against the success rate above \u2014 a vendor that simply does not model page.viewed looked broken. Reasons: unsubscribed / filtered / consent come from the gate, unmapped means the gate passed and the vendor has no mapper, no_active_destinations means nobody has enabled this vendor for the project. A step change here after a config edit is the expected signal; a step change WITHOUT one is a config that changed underneath you.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
