      "description": "2 means the runtime is refusing deliveries to this instance without calling the vendor, after consecutive transient failures. 1 is a probe in flight. Breakers are per REPLICA and in-memory, so several series for one destination_id is expected \u2014 each replica discovers the vendor is down independently, which is what avoids needing consensus about who owns the probe.",
